      "dc:source": "crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-act-2023.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "Subsection 126(3A) of the Anti-Money Laundering and\nCounter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006, as inserted by this Part, applies\nto disclosures of AUSTRAC information that occur on or after the\ncommencement of this item, whether the AUSTRAC information was\nobtained before, on or after that commencement.\n\nAnti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006  Schedule 1\nComputer-assisted decision making  Part 3\nNo. 63, 2023\nCrimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus) Act 2023",
      "skos:definition": "Subsection 126(3A) of the Anti-Money Laundering and\nCounter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006, as inserted by this Part, applies\nto disclosures of AUSTRAC information that occur on or after the\ncommencement of this item, whether the AUSTRAC information was\nobtained before, on or after that commencement.\n\nAnti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006  Schedule 1\nComputer-assisted decision making  Part 3\nNo. 63, 2023\nCrimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus) Act 2023",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-act-2023-sch-1-sec-6-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f2635b5d49cbbf9b15fd0637655e7070d6ce3e8fa0067aeb3bab7da6f618a3ce",
      "skos:note": "Application of amendments"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-act-2023#sch-1-sec-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 Application of amendments",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "Subsection 126(3A) of the Anti-Money Laundering and\nCounter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006, as inserted by this Part, applies\nto disclosures of AUSTRAC information that occur on or after the\ncommencement of this item, whether the AUSTRAC information was\nobtained before, on or after that commencement.\n\nAnti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006  Schedule 1\nComputer-assisted decision making  Part 3\nNo. 63, 2023\nCrimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus) Act 2023"
    },
