      "values:originalText": "The amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to:\n(a) applications under section 16 of the International Transfer of\nPrisoners Act 1997; and\n(b) requests under section 24 of that Act; and\n(c) requests under section 33 of that Act;\nmade on or after the commencement of this Schedule.\n\nGrounds to refuse mutual assistance requests  Schedule 7\n\nNo. 63, 2023\nCrimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus) Act 2023",
