          "@id": "concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-act-2023-sch-9-sec-29a-ss-1-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "31d8723e0df2aa1ac37d1f2e4fc392c245b585b89a60817515d77cd85cf89f08",
      "skos:note": "A person who was in a witness protection program before the Act's commencement must comply with this section."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-act-2023#sch-9-sec-29a-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "29A(1) Past program participants",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 27,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to a person (a past program participant) who:\n(a) was, at some time before the commencement of this Act,\nincluded in a program (the past program) operated by the\nAustralian Federal Police for the purpose of witness\nprotection before the commencement of this Act; but\n(b) was not included in the past program immediately before the\ncommencement of this Act.\nNote 1:\nThis Act commenced on 18 April 1995.\nNote 2:\nThe transitional provision in subsection 29(2) applies to people who\nwere included in the past program immediately before the\ncommencement of this Act."
    },
    {
