      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-act-2023.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "(6) However, subsection (5) does not prevent protection or assistance\nbeing provided under the NWPP to a participant while a\nsuspension under this section is in effect for the participant if the\nCommissioner is satisfied that, in the circumstances, it is necessary\nand reasonable for the protection or assistance to be provided\ndespite the suspension.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) However, subsection (5) does not prevent protection or assistance\nbeing provided under the NWPP to a participant while a\nsuspension under this section is in effect for the participant if the\nCommissioner is satisfied that, in the circumstances, it is necessary\nand reasonable for the protection or assistance to be provided\ndespite the suspension.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-act-2023-sch-9-sec-17a"
      },
