      "values:originalText": "Repeal the item, substitute:\nIndependent\nCommission\nAgainst\nCorruption of\nSouth Australia\nthe\nCommissioner\nof the\nCommission\n(a) the\nCommissioner;\nor\n(b) the Deputy\nCommissioner;\nor\n(c) a member of the\nstaff of the\nCommission; or\n(d) an examiner or\ninvestigator\n(within the\nmeaning of the\nIndependent\n(a) the\nCommissioner;\nor\n(b) the Deputy\nCommissioner;\nor\n(c) an executive\nlevel member of\nthe staff of the\nCommission the\nchief officer\nauthorises under\nsubsection (5)\n\nSchedule 10  Amendments relating to the South Australian Independent Commission\nAgainst Corruption\n\nCrimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus) Act 2023\nNo. 63, 2023\nCommission\nAgainst\nCorruption Act\n2012 (SA)) of\nthe Commission\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the item, substitute:\nIndependent\nCommission\nAgainst\nCorruption of\nSouth Australia\nthe\nCommissioner\nof the\nCommission\n(a) the\nCommissioner;\nor\n(b) the Deputy\nCommissioner;\nor\n(c) a member of the\nstaff of the\nCommission; or\n(d) an examiner or\ninvestigator\n(within the\nmeaning of the\nIndependent\n(a) the\nCommissioner;\nor\n(b) the Deputy\nCommissioner;\nor\n(c) an executive\nlevel member of\nthe staff of the\nCommission the\nchief officer\nauthorises under\nsubsection (5)\n\nSchedule 10  Amendments relating to the South Australian Independent Commission\nAgainst Corruption\n\nCrimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus) Act 2023\nNo. 63, 2023\nCommission\nAgainst\nCorruption Act\n2012 (SA)) of\nthe Commission\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979",
