      "dc:source": "crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-act-2023.pdf, p.40",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n(p) each of the following is an eligible purpose of the\nIndependent Commission Against Corruption (SA):\n(i) an investigation under the Independent Commission\nAgainst Corruption Act (SA) into corruption in public\nadministration (within the meaning of that Act);\n(ii) a report on such an investigation.\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 29 March 2023\nSenate on 13 June 2023]\n(36/23)",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n(p) each of the following is an eligible purpose of the\nIndependent Commission Against Corruption (SA):\n(i) an investigation under the Independent Commission\nAgainst Corruption Act (SA) into corruption in public\nadministration (within the meaning of that Act);\n(ii) a report on such an investigation.\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 29 March 2023\nSenate on 13 June 2023]\n(36/23)",
      "cml:asserts": [
